review lifecycle were removed; the round-one question goes through
`ask-invoker` inside an executor; a rebase is compared with `hw review-delta`;
findings only one judge raised are verified and listed; a defect already at the
base does not block; a design mode was added; background judges are awaited
without `ScheduleWakeup`. The method is unchanged. Each SKILL.md keeps its
upstream author line.

Changes made to the agents: the model is fixed per agent instead of templated
(`jd-judge-b` runs on a different model than `jd-judge-a` on purpose); the
refuter and multi-lens review text, which belongs to Gentle AI's review
lifecycle, was replaced by Judgment Day's own two-judge verification; a defect
already at the base does not block.
